0, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16efy.jpg"}], "slug": "fragfield", "summary": "FragField is a low-poly multiplayer first-person shooter focused on large team battles. Two teams fight for control of capture zones on open maps, using class-based loadouts and a variety of vehicles including trucks, APCs, tanks and helicopters. Scoring is frag-based: kills, zone captures and team-support actions all contribute to the team total. The game is designed to run at high frame rates on low-end PCs. Formerly announced as Flick Frag.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/fragfield", "videos": [{"id": 202195, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "u4sVK8K864U", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u4sVK8K864U", "title": "FRAG FIELD - Trailer (v1) | Low-Poly Military FPS", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/u4sVK8K864U/fhddefault.jpg"}]}